<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Reed estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Reed estimate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch on Thursday cut its 1997 pre-tax profit estimate for Reed International Plc, market sources said.</p>
<p>Merrill cut its estimate to 864 million stg from 895 million, citing a poorer-than-expected performance from Reed's travel unit and the impact of the strong pound, sources said.</p>
<p>Merrill also cut its short-term rating on Reed shares to &quot;accumulate&quot; from &quot;buy,&quot; reflecting the recent strength of the stock, sources said.</p>
<p>Reed shares fell 17p to 608-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
